    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "动物的家：简单句",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "Animals' homes" },
        { "id": "g1", "kind": "table", "rows": [
          ["owl 猫头鹰", "An owl lives in a tree."],
          ["eagle 老鹰", "An eagle lives on a hill."],
          ["fish 鱼", "Fish live in water."]
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "an owl, an eagle：元音开头用 an" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "动物们住在哪里？我们用简单的句子说一说。" },
        { "spotlight": "g1" },
        { "say": "猫头鹰住在树上。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "An owl lives in a tree.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "老鹰住在小山上。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "An eagle lives on a hill.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "鱼住在水里。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "Fish live in water.", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "你发现了吗？猫头鹰和老鹰前面不是一个小词，而是另一个，因为它们开头是元音的读音。" },
        { "say": "an owl, an eagle", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
