        { "say": "It can fly high.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "莉莉问：树上那是什么？" },
        { "say": "What's that in the tree?", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "汤姆说：是一只猫头鹰，它白天睡觉。" },
        { "say": "It's an owl. It sleeps in the day.", "lang": "en" },
