    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "语音：字母 i 的短音",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "Sound: i" },
        { "id": "c1", "kind": "cards", "items": [
          { "id": "c1a", "text": "big 大的", "color": "blue" },
          { "id": "c1b", "text": "fish 鱼", "color": "green" },
          { "id": "c1c", "text": "six 六", "color": "orange" }
        ] },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "对比：kite、five 里的 i 读字母本身的音" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "学发音。这三个单词里的元音字母读短音，嘴角微微咧开，声音短短的。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "big, big", "lang": "en" },
        { "board": [
          { "text": "b - i - g → big" },
          { "text": "f - i - sh → fish" }
        ] },
        { "say": "一个音一个音拼，再连起来读。" },
        { "say": "b, i, g, big. f, i, sh, fish.", "lang": "en" },
        { "boardClose": true },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "fish, fish", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1c" },
        { "say": "six, six", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "再听这两个词，结尾有一个不发音的字母，前面的字母读它本身的名字。" },
        { "say": "kite, five", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
